\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>41600</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>220 Intel</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>44800</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>49600</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>57600</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>460 Intel</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>The experience and intel required to upgrade Pilots has been adjusted for every level:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Pilot level</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Experience per level</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Intel Cost per level Upgrade</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>1</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>-</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>-</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>2</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>1000</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>100</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>3</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>2000</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>200</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>4</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>5000</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>500</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>5</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>10000</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>1000</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: This event is exclusively available on the Early Access version of War Robots: Frontiers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Contest: Star Showcase</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Create a screenshot, video, or fanart of your festive build in War Robots: Frontiers, and share it with the hashtags #WRFShowcase and #WRFrontiers on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a> (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/WRFrontiers\">Twitter</a>), <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/1491000\">Steam Community Hub</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> before December 31 for your chance to win a <strong>Festive Croc Sticker </strong>and <strong>special Discord role! </strong>Check out the rules <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/en/pages/war-robots-frontiers-community-events-rules\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/12/154-WinterEvent/2.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep your eyes on the skies, Pilots, and don&rsquo;t miss the Wandering Star!&nbsp;</p>",
